1
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:04,357
This website made people wait.

2
00:00:04,477 --> 00:00:05,883
And they liked it more.

3
00:00:06,503 --> 00:00:09,362
Harvard researchers built two flight searches.

4
00:00:09,482 --> 00:00:11,592
One gave you results instantly.

5
00:00:11,712 --> 00:00:13,279
The other made you wait.

6
00:00:13,599 --> 00:00:15,042
But it showed its work.

7
00:00:15,162 --> 00:00:18,377
Checking this airline. Then that one. Then the next.

8
00:00:18,697 --> 00:00:20,339
Same flights at the end.

9
00:00:20,959 --> 00:00:23,168
People rated the slow one higher.

10
00:00:23,288 --> 00:00:25,125
Even when it took a full minute.

11
00:00:25,645 --> 00:00:27,447
It's called the labor illusion.

12
00:00:28,167 --> 00:00:29,908
People don't hate waiting.

13
00:00:30,128 --> 00:00:31,902
They hate waiting blind.

14
00:00:32,822 --> 00:00:34,845
This TikTok did the same thing.

15
00:00:34,965 --> 00:00:36,573
Every step, on screen.

16
00:00:36,693 --> 00:00:38,604
A counter that never stopped.

17
00:00:38,724 --> 00:00:41,171
You never once asked how long it was.

18
00:00:42,091 --> 00:00:43,898
That's how Rasolv works.

19
00:00:44,018 --> 00:00:46,079
A real expert on your problem.

20
00:00:46,199 --> 00:00:47,601
Every step, live.

21
00:00:48,321 --> 00:00:50,440
Rasolv. Vision that solves.
